00:09:05.211 --> 00:09:07.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I would say -- To your mother
I would say "What ho?"

00:09:07.914 --> 00:09:11.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"What ho?" is a perfect -
perfect response.

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
